Which of the following identities correctly expresses the complex conjugate of a three-term product $overline(z_1 z_2 z_3)$ for any $z_1, z_2, z_3 in CC$?

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ overline(z)_1 overline(z)_2 overline(z)_3 $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ - overline(z)_1 overline(z)_2 overline(z)_3 $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ overline(z)_1 + overline(z)_2 + overline(z)_3 $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ (overline(z_1 z_2)) / overline(z)_3 $

